  unitName: Light God
  unitId: 50204
  unitNumber: 268
  description: This subspecies of Metal God is said to hold within its massive body
    an enormous collection of information on the known world. They have a very relaxed
    personality, and, despite them being a subspecies, they are considered the elders
    of the metal record species. They also have a great variety of knowledge which
    is not just useful in improving the lives of members of their fellow species,
    but is also used to give useful advice to humans which has helped them to gain
    recognition among normal people, too.
  summonDesc: Summoner,<br>we don't mind being fused but<br>please use us wisely.
